  "prompts": {
    "image": "Create a cinematic 16:9 landscape product presentation frame, 1920x1080 composition, for a weekly award video with future HTML text overlays. Reference image is the binding canonical golden emoji TROPHY: circular thick gold medal, raised four-point star eyes, open smiling mouth and curved gold cradle resembling two victory arms. Preserve exact geometry, proportions and face; no black pedestal or additional base. Place the complete trophy on a seamless matte off-white studio floor/background, no horizon, positioned centered at x=28% of canvas width, bottom at y=83%, top near y=20%, entirely within left 47%. Right half is clean empty off-white negative space for channel name and song title added later. Near-frontal view with mild 10 degree angle, locked eye-level product camera and long lens. Premium realistic polished gold, broad softbox highlights, soft contact shadow directly beneath the gold cradle, restrained warm halo close to sculpture only. Neutral bright white-to-pale-grey backdrop, subtle depth, no architecture, no curtains, no people, no text, no logos, no extra objects, no particles, no sparkles floating around. Beauty still, physically believable and faithful to reference. Background must be opaque. Do not center the trophy across full canvas; preserve the large blank RIGHT half.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Identyczny kadr końcowy. Kamera i bryła bez zmian; planowana zmiana poświaty wyłącznie wewnątrz przyszłej animacji.",
